config MTK_MT6878_GPUEB_RESET_PROVIDER
	tristate "MT6878 GPUEB parent-owned reset checkpoint (draft)"
	depends on ARM64 && OF && PM && RESET_CONTROLLER
	default n
	help
	  Register an assertion-only reset provider from a fixed, already powered
	  unified GPUEB parent. Requires the reviewed SRAM/reset helper objects
	  in the same integration. No automatic probe, firmware upload or start.
	  Stop containment retains all claims until reboot; not physical OFF.
